## This app's own documents

- `CLAUDE.md` — the working contract for an agent here. `AGENTS.md` is a symlink to it. Its project block is yours; its framework block is regenerated.
- `docs/ARCHITECTURE.md` — what this app is made of and which parts may not touch which, with the reasoning. Project-owned.
- `docs/FEATURE.md` — **how** a unit of work gets built here, step by step. Read before building one.
- `docs/PLAN.md` — **what** is being built, in order, and what each slice proves.
- `docs/README.md` — the map of the four, and what is deliberately not written.
- `.env.example` — every variable this app reads, with a name and a blank. Never a value. `.env` and `config/master.key` are gitignored and stay that way.

## Where each kind of file goes

One declaration per file; the path says what the file declares before you open it. `magik docs Project-Layout` is the full rule, in both directions.

- `app/models/` — `model :Invoice` → `app/models/invoice.rb`. Data, validations, scopes. It describes; it does not act.
- `app/screens/` — `screen :Invoices` → `app/screens/invoices.rb`, auto-routed to `/invoices`. Declares `state`, renders, links to actions. **Never queries.**
- `app/components/` — `component :MoneyCell` → `app/components/money_cell.rb`. Driven by `prop`s, no data access.
- `app/actions/` — `action :mark_paid` → `app/actions/mark_paid.rb`. The only thing that mutates.
- `app/jobs/` · `app/channels/` · `app/ledgers/` · `app/flows/` · `app/api/` · `app/webhooks/` · `app/notifications/` — same rule, one kind each.
- `db/migrations/` — hand-written, append-only, numerically ordered. `db/schema.rb` is generated and never hand-edited.
- `config/app.rb` — `App.define :<%= app_class %>`, the composition root: tenancy, swap points, auth, billing, theme, locales, admin.
- `test/` — mirrors `app/` exactly, one file per declaration. Minitest, never RSpec.
<% if layout == :domains -%>
- `domains/<name>/` — the same `app/` tree one level in, plus `domain.rb` declaring `depends_on`, `exposes`, `publishes_events`.
<% end -%>

## The agent harness

- `.claude/commands/setup-project.md` — **run first in a new app.** Interviews, then writes this app's architecture, plan and feature loop.
- `.claude/commands/feature.md` · `screen.md` · `check.md` · `next.md` — the everyday loop.
- `.claude/agents/` — `data-modeler`, `action-author`, `screen-builder`, `ledger-author`, `test-writer`, `guardrail-reviewer`. Scoped by **file set**, not by role, so two can run without colliding.
- `.claude/settings.json` — the allowlist. `magik` commands, read-only git and read-only shell are pre-approved; destructive database commands, force pushes and anything touching `.env` or `config/master.key` are denied.

